272:In this section, we present the construction given by Adhikary et al.~\cite{ABMR20} of an interval graph that proves NP-completeness of {\sc MaxCut} in this class. As we see in Section~\ref{sec:proof}, the general idea behind their construction can also be used to obtain a permutation graph instead. Nevertheless, the question of whether their construction is also permutation might arise. We prove here that this is not the case.
