+coefficient vector by Gauss-Jordan elimination on
+<c,label[u] XOR label[v]>=1 for every source edge.  The module reports this
+successful O(m d^2)-bit reference method separately.  The compact route XORs
+all labels and emits its bits.  Plants and decoys are marginally sampled from
+the same parity half-spaces; the final label is merely the conditional draw
+imposed by the global invariant.  Dense secret weight defeats a best-single-
+coordinate outlier.  Coordinate ascent, 4096 uniform restarts, and a
+coordinate-wise label-majority ansatz are also tested on eight shipping seeds.
+""".strip()
