All local gates pass: unique density `1/2^96`, 0/200,000 guesses, four attacks at 0/8, reference elimination at 8/8, and 211 intended-route operations.

Final shipping certification is blocked externally: every oracle call returned HTTP 403 “Key limit exceeded.” The three transcripts contain only harness-recorded errors, not fabricated model failures. Once the OpenRouter allowance is restored, the bare and G9 runs must be repeated before submission.
